      "body": "Add one comment to `.github/workflows/_unit-tests.yml` to exercise Testmon selection for a workflow-only PR. This is a temporary CI control; do not merge.\n\nThe PR targets current `main`, whose unit-test selection still uses the CPU planner. It provides a separate control alongside the GPU selection changes in #8716. The diff changes no Python source, tests, dependencies, or workflow execution settings.\n\nEnable `Run selective unit tests` and inspect H100/GB200 selection plans, selected-test counts, fallback reasons, and selection duration. This comment should add no affected Python tests; baseline age or compatibility failures can still cause tests to be selected or buckets to run in full.\n\nValidation: parsed workflow YAML is unchanged; all 56 recipe cache identities match the parent commit; the diff contains exactly one workflow file and passes whitespace checks. GPU tests were not run locally.\n\n## Code provenance\n\nOriginal comment; no code copied or adapted from external sources.\n",
